+python-differential-check: 10001/10001 passed; mismatches=0
+```
+
+Concrete LLVM build and execution:
+
+```bash
+kompile reference-semantics/semantics.k \
+  --backend llvm \
+  --main-module MPY-KRUN \
+  --syntax-module MPY-SYNTAX \
